---
// DriverCTA.astro - Llamado a la acción para conductores
---

<section class="section driver-cta-section" id="publicar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="driver-cta-card">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <div class="badge badge-sand cta-badge">
          <span>🚗 ¿Tienes vehículo propio?</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="cta-title">
          No viajes solo: comparte gastos de gasolina y conoce gente genial
        </h2>
        <p class="cta-description">
          Si viajas todos los días entre Santa Tecla, San Salvador, Santa Ana o bajas los fines de semana a surfear al Puerto de La Libertad, publica tus asientos vacíos y cubre hasta el 70% de tus costos de mantenimiento y combustible.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-perks-list">
          <div class="perk-item">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#8FD6C8"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
            <span>Tú eliges el horario y el precio sugerido</span>
          </div>
          <div class="perk-item">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#8FD6C8"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
            <span>Aceptas solo pasajeros verificados</span>
          </div>
          <div class="perk-item">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#8FD6C8"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
            <span>Sin intermediarios abusivos ni ataduras</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="/publicar" class="btn btn-seafoam" id="btn-open-driver-modal">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line>
              <line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line>
            </svg>
            <span>Publicar un Viaje Ahora</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/#como-funciona" class="btn btn-outline cta-outline-btn">
            Saber Más Requisitos
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Graphical Coastal Badge -->
      <div class="cta-graphic-side" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="graphic-circle outer-ring"></div>
        <div class="graphic-circle inner-ring"></div>
        <div class="graphic-stat-floating">
          <span class="float-emoji">🌊</span>
          <div class="float-text">
            <strong>Ruta al Mar</strong>
            <span>4 cupos llenos</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="graphic-stat-savings">
          <span class="savings-amount">+$120</span>
          <span class="savings-desc">recuperados al mes</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .driver-cta-section {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .driver-cta-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-ocean) 100%);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 48px -10px rgba(11, 93, 103, 0.4);
  }

  .cta-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .cta-badge {
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .cta-title {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .cta-description {
    color: rgba(242, 233, 216, 0.9);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-perks-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .perk-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cta-outline-btn {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .cta-outline-btn:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  /* Graphical Decorative Side */
  .cta-graphic-side {
    position: relative;
    height: 320px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .graphic-circle {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .outer-ring {
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    border: 2px dashed rgba(143, 214, 200, 0.35);
    animation: rotateSlow 40s linear infinite;
  }

  .inner-ring {
    width: 190px;
    height: 190px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(143, 214, 200, 0.25) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  @keyframes rotateSlow {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  .graphic-stat-floating {
    position: absolute;
    top: 25%;
    left: 10%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    color: var(--color-slate);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    animation: floatGentle 5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .float-emoji {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .float-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .float-text strong {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .float-text span {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-slate-muted);
  }

  .graphic-stat-savings {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20%;
    right: 10%;
    background: var(--color-sand);
    color: var(--color-slate);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    animation: floatGentle 6s ease-in-out infinite reverse;
  }

  .savings-amount {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .savings-desc {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-slate);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .driver-cta-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.75rem;
    }
    .cta-graphic-side {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
